version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-25"
abstract: >-
  A re-evaluation of an Indonesian suicide-ideation classifier. 739 of 2,026 validation posts (36.5%) are near-duplicates of a training row; on the 1,287 unseen rows fine-tuned IndoBERT reaches positive-class F1 0.877 [0.845, 0.904] and the remaining advantage over a character n-gram baseline is +0.090 [+0.049, +0.131].
